<title>SWEDEN: N&amp;T gives ship option to Kvaerner.</title>
<headline>N&amp;T gives ship option to Kvaerner.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish shipping group Nordstrom &amp; Thulin said on Tuesday it had given an option to Norwegian group Kvaerner to acquire the ship Nord Jahre Princess for about $40 million.</p>
<p>The option should be redeemed at the latest in mid-January 1998 and if it is used the buyer has the right to buy the sister ship Nord Jahre Progress on the same conditions.</p>
<p>If both options are used, it will boost Nordstrom &amp; Thulin's earnings by 115 million crowns and increase liquidity by about 175 million crowns, the company said.</p>
<p>Nord Jahre Princess is 97,000 dwt and was built in 1991.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
